# dictionary-demo.ine
# A small coherent landing page written as a first-time Ine user.
#
# Discovery trail used to write this file (see the session report for details):
#   kinds found via            ine --dict
#   members + properties via   ine --dict <kind>
#   statement grammar (make / inside / property / say / group) via LANGUAGE.md
# Anything the dictionary did NOT guide is flagged in a comment below.

make page
page title "Drift Coffee"

make header
header inside page

make logo
logo text "Drift Coffee"
logo inside header

make navigation
navigation inside header
# Note: navigation has no `contains` and there is no "link" kind in the
# dictionary, so this nav carries no links (same as the real examples).

make container
container inside page

make banner
banner text "Welcome to Drift Coffee"
banner inside container

# card-group is dictionary-contained (container -> card-group; Session 26).
make card-group card-group
card-group inside container

# `make 2 card` (multiplicity) and `group` are LANGUAGE.md syntax.
make 2 card
group cards = card-1 card-2
cards inside card-group

card-1 title "Mornings"
card-1 text "Small-batch brews, served fast."
card-2 title "Evenings"
card-2 text "Slow corners, loud music, no rush."

# section is dictionary-contained too (page -> section; Session 26).
make section
section title "Order ahead"
section text "Skip the line: grab your cup early."
section inside page

# `button label` is suggested by --dict button, but the HTML/visual targets
# render a node's visible content from its `text` property, so we set `text`.
make button
button text "Order now"
button inside section

say page title